def rem_10_3_skorokhod_intro : String :=
  "There is a partial converse to Theorem 10.7: if $X_n$ converges in " ++
  "distribution to a constant $c$, then $X_n$ converges in probability to the" ++
  " same constant.\n\nWe conclude this section with Skorokhod's representation " ++
  "theorem, which provides a relationship between convergence in distribution" ++
  " and almost sure convergence."
